  "ingredients": [
    "1 (9 inch) refrigerated pie pastry",
    "1 cup shredded Cheddar cheese, divided",
    "0.5 cup shredded Swiss cheese",
    "2 tablespoons all-purpose flour, divided",
    "0.5 cup diced cooked ham",
    "2 tablespoons honey mustard",
    "1.25 cups half-and-half",
    "5 eggs, beaten",
    "0.25 cup chopped green onions",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Pry4XKWwHBvFA12lOBSKTFTfOHE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241251-creamy-ham-and-cheese-quiche-Step-001-07c3aa21509a48598468a5c5501a2feb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241251/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press pastry into the bottom of a 9-inch pie plate. Bake in the preheated oven for 5 minutes. Poke holes into the pastry with a fork and continue cooking until lightly browned, about 5 minutes more. Remove crust from the oven, and reduce the oven temperature to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fcuwI-TWKWmDbJpD1DkFqru5A4A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241251-creamy-ham-and-cheese-quiche-Step-002-864200eafa554bc89999c3a8ec7f916e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241251/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix 1/2 cup Cheddar cheese, Swiss cheese, and 1 tablespoon flour in a bowl; spread over warm crust.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_DG9byOeD5Io6HGmq2ULA6jy2mQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241251-creamy-ham-and-cheese-quiche-Step-004-cec11ffea4d244928bdda16ecb37dc11.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241251/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix ham and honey mustard together in a bowl; spoon over cheese mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZVS1lgf33DdFmgau4cNz1755Gm0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241251-creamy-ham-and-cheese-quiche-Step-005-b8dd4ca8154844e5a4e61d676336cd92.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241251/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix half-and-half, eggs, green onions, remaining 1 tablespoon flour, and salt together in bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Y_q7olzdEOvO8DRNV7Nj3kIME0M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241251-creamy-ham-and-cheese-quiche-Step-006-8a190de7df1c4b8c92aab7df3e1ef0ec.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241251/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour mixture carefully over ham layer; top with remaining Cheddar cheese.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9BB_N-Up4eAJzTcmRdzFBMSQDNk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241251-creamy-ham-and-cheese-quiche-Step-007-1-1159791a96b34e52a696b8976c3d0a0a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241251/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 40 to 50 minutes until set in the center. Cool briefly before cutting and serving.",
